ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=mi
 khail.galkin@intel.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:mikhail.galkin@intel.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=mi
 khail.galkin@mila.quebec;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:mikhail.galkin@mila.quebec
