ORGANIZER;CN=vdujn2pbpkhgr5f55cm39qbmu8@group.calendar.google.com:mailto:vd
 ujn2pbpkhgr5f55cm39qbmu8@group.calendar.google.com
UID:FEEAEC38-0494-443E-BE84-F231E30E5AF5
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=geiger
 .mario@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:geiger.mario@gmail.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20220816T170000
CREATED:20220820T195614Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><b>Speaker:<br></b>Me (H
 annes Stark PhD at MIT) with the help of Dr. Mario Geiger who is a PostDoc 
 at MIT in the group of Prof. Tess Smidt.<br><br><b>Paper:</b><br><b>e3nn: E
 uclidean Neural Networks&nbsp\;</b><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.0945
 3" class="paper-link" style="display: inline-block\;">https://arxiv.org/abs
 /2207.09453</a>&nbsp\;(<a href="https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=auth
 or&amp\;query=Geiger%2C+M">Mario Geiger</a>\,&nbsp\;<a href="https://arxiv.
 org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp\;query=Smidt%2C+T">Tess Smidt</a>)<br>W
 e present e3nn\, a generalized framework for creating E(3) equivariant trai
 nable functions\, also known as Euclidean neural networks. e3nn naturally o
 perates on geometry and geometric tensors that describe systems in 3D and t
 ransform predictably under a change of coordinate system. The core of e3nn 
 are equivariant operations such as the TensorProduct class or the spherical
  harmonics functions that can be composed to create more complex modules su
 ch as convolutions and attention mechanisms. These core operations of e3nn 
 can be used to efficiently articulate Tensor Field Networks\, 3D Steerable 
 CNNs\, Clebsch-Gordan Networks\, SE(3) Transformers and other E(3) equivari
 ant networks.<b><br></b><br><u></u><b>Meeting Details:<br></b><i>Every Tues
 day at</i><i> </i><i>5pm CEST / 3pm UTC / 11am EST / 8am PDT.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
 </i><br><a href="https://zoom.us/j/5775722530?pwd=ZzlGTXlDNThhUDZOdU4vN2JRM
 m5pQT09">https://zoom.us/j/5775722530?pwd=ZzlGTXlDNThhUDZOdU4vN2JRMm5pQT09<
 /a><br><br><b>Slack Workspace for discussion and paper voting:<br></b><a hr
 ef="https://join.slack.com/t/logag/shared_invite/zt-u0mbo1ec-zElmvd1oSCXGjX
 vxLSokvg">https://join.slack.com/t/<u></u>logag/shared_invite/zt-<u></u>u0m
 bo1ec-<u></u>zElmvd1oSCXGjXvxLSokvg</a><br><br><b>All information: Schedule
  of upcoming papers\, recordings\, mailing list</b><b>:<br></b><u><a href="
 https://hannes-stark.com/logag-reading-group">https://hannes-stark.com/loga
 g-reading-group</a></u><b><br></b><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
