ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=Guanda
 o Yang;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:gy46@cornell.edu
