DESCRIPTION:<b>No paper ?!</b><br><br>The&nbsp\;<a href="https://neurips.cc
 /virtual/2021/calendar">NeurIPS</a>&nbsp\;schedule is out and it starts on 
 Monday\, Dec 6th and the first poster session is on Tuesday\, Dec 7th at 4:
 30 pm UTC - 30 minutes after this meeting.<br><br>So\, we are only meeting 
 for 30 minutes until the poster sessions start and we will not discuss a sp
 ecific paper but have a&nbsp\;<b>"NeurIPS GraphML orientation session"</b>!
 &nbsp\;&nbsp\;:D<br><br>We share with each other what GraphML/GeometricDL p
 apers to look out for and share recommendations for what poster presentatio
 ns to visit!<br>Then\, at the end of this meeting\, you can jump onto the N
 eurIPS GatherTown and visit the GraphML poster presentations that interest 
 you the most.<br><br>I hope that will help us get the most out of NeurIPS a
 nd I am curious to hear what your favorite NeurIPS GraphML paper is\, so co
 me with a recommendation!<br><b><br></b><b>Meeting Details:<br></b><i>Every
  Tuesday at 5pm CET / 4pm UTC / 11am EDT / 8am PT</i><br><a href="https://z
