ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=arnaud
 doucet@google.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:arnauddoucet@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=valent
 in.debortoli@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:valentin.debortoli@gmail.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=vdebor
 toli@google.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:vdebortoli@google.com
