ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=qu
 anquan.gu@bytedance.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:quanquan.gu@bytedance.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=sh
 enxiaolulu@bytedance.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:shenxiaolulu@bytedance.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=zh
 ouyi.naive@bytedance.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:zhouyi.naive@bytedance.com
